1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
This pagoda looks nine floors tall.
这塔看着九层

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
Inside? Seventeen hidden levels.
里头藏着十七层

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,000
Nine hundred years — all brick and wood.
九百年砖木不倒

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,400
Its walls hold a thousand Buddhas.
墙里供着千尊佛

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,800
That's the "Thousand-Buddha Pagoda."
人称千佛塔

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,400
And the temple's name? A poet gave it.
寺名,是位诗人起的

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,400
Su Dongpo saw six banyans — wrote "Six Banyans."
苏东坡见六榕,提笔就写

9
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,600
★ Expert Tip: come at opening, nine tiers glow at dawn.
内行提示:开门就来,晨光最美

10
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,000
Nine outside, seventeen within — which fooled you?
外九内十七,你信几层?
